  "question": {
    "text": "Sodium metal crystallizes in a body centred cubic lattice with a unit cell edge of <math><mn>4.29</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#8491;</mi></math> . The radius of sodium atom is approximately:",
